{"author":"Joe Oakhart","author_email":"joeoakhart@navapbc.com","data":{"body":"Shipped as navapbc/agentic-development-platform#21 on branch adevx-133-open-pr-clears-repair-band. Lifted the open-PR band base into _post_repair_sequence_base and shared it between _open_pull_request and _promote, so repair commits no longer outrank the open-PR step. Full suite 1532 passed, 19 skipped. Verified in production, pilot 5d28 completed a run that needed a CI repair and reached PR_CREATED, PR_LINKED and BRANCH_PROMOTED with zero discards."},"env_id":"8c3ef925-fbdc-4d88-8d59-f391cf59568c","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1789933578688701001,"uuid":"cd3c6640-4251-4960-846e-9331b00cd20e"}